      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this 2 bed 2 bath Duplex to the market located in the popular development of Waterville. This property has been beautifully presented throughout with the ideal location only within minutes' walk to Blanchardstown Village, Blanchardstown shopping centre, Connolly Hospital and Waterville Park. The M50 and N3 are located close by, with multiple bus routes outside the development making commuting around Dublin and beyond hassle free.\nBright, spacious and well-proportioned living accommodation extending to approximately 77 sq. m. is presented here. The property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, two generous double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, with the principal bedroom further benefiting from a private balcony and ensuite bathroom. The property also features a bright and light-filled sitting room with access to a second private balcony, along with a separate kitchen/dining room, ideal for entertaining and hosting guests. A main family bathroom completes the accommodation. Further benefits include additional attic space, providing excellent potential for storage.\nNo. 12 comes to the market in fantastic condition throughout and has been well maintained by its current owners. Further benefits here include B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, gas fired central heating, attic space, double glazed windows, top quality fixtures and fittings, two balconies filling the home with direct sunlight, and communal parking. Due to layout and location we know this property will be extremely popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest.\n\nFeatures: \n<ul>\n <li>2 BED/ 2 BATH</li>\n <li>Duplex</li>\n <li>BER B qualifying of a green mortgage</li>\n <li>Additional attic space ideal for storage</li>\n <li>c. 77 sq m</li>\n <li>Turn key condition</li>\n <li>Modernised layout throughout</li>\n <li>2 balconies on either side of the property</li>\n <li>Communal parking</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Management fees c. 2,200 p/a</li>\n <li>Top quality fixtures & fittings</li>\n <li>Located in the Waterville Development</li>\n <li>Fantastic for all buyers</li>\n <li>Connolly Hospital a short stroll away</li>\n <li>Blanch Shopping Centre and Blanch Village within minutes</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode =  D15 FP64"
      },
      {
